This product includes an independent implementation of GGUF model loading, tokenization and inference.
It reads the GGUF file format and is validated against llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT License)
and the `gguf` Python package; no llama.cpp source code is included. Model files are not distributed with this project
and remain under their own licenses.
LM Studio, llama.cpp, OpenAI and model names are trademarks of their respective owners; this project is not affiliated with them.
Models used in tests and benchmarks (not distributed; each keeps its own license): Liquid AI LFM2/LFM2.5/LFM2.5-VL, Google Gemma 3, Qwen2.5-Coder (Alibaba Cloud),
DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen and DeepSeek-Coder-V2-Lite, IBM Granite 3.2, Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407, Nomic nomic-embed-text-v1.5.
Developed with the assistance of Claude (Anthropic) as a technical partner; the author reviews and is responsible for what is published.
